{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"B2: Balancing a redox reaction","title_html":"B2: Balancing a redox reaction","html":"<p>Potassium permanganate reacts with hydrochloric acid: <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\na\\, \\mathrm{KMnO_4} + b\\, \\mathrm{HCl} \\longrightarrow c\\, \\mathrm{KCl}\n+ d\\, \\mathrm{MnCl_2} + e\\, \\mathrm{H_2O} + f\\, \\mathrm{Cl_2} .\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c48\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27F6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D450 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n